If you're neither wizard class nor neutral you may want
Magicbane anyways.  Some folks collect as many artifacts
as possible.  One way to get cross-aligned artifacts is
the few types of monsters that can be created with them.
An arch lich has a 5% chance of being generated with MB
if it does not already exist.  Play extinctionist and
face 120 of them and there is a huge chance you'll get
MB for your efforts.

